# main-tema-aurora: the real main screen under the shipped "Aurora" theme
# (rootfs/usr/share/x6200/themes/Aurora.json: deep aubergine, lavender readings
# and coral for TX/alarm, with turquoise notes; the theme names `font: inter`,
# so the frequency row and the clock draw with Inter here without the fixture
# asking for a family). Same radio state as home-usb-20m, so the theme is the
# only variable: the render is Aurora's identity of the main screen (frequency
# row, mode, VFO, S-meter, band plan and waterfall).
#
# It is also the fixture of the non-text contract for Aurora (`s_meter_arc` and
# `waterfall_signal` in tools/ab_testing/quality/nontext.yaml, WCAG 1.4.11 over
# its committed golden render).

name main-tema-aurora
screen main

theme Aurora
seed 20

frequency_hz 14074000
tx_frequency_hz 14074000
fft_width_hz 384000

mode usb
vfo A
agc auto

split false
att false
pre false
atu false
ant 1

smeter_db -73

battery_v 12.1
external_v 13.8
battery_cap 76
charging false

rxtx rx
